#. <CLT 4>毒薬のビンにはプロテインの粉末が入ってた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The bottle of \"poison\" was actually filled with\n"
"protein powder.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、<CLT><CLT 3>逆に毒薬が入れられてた<CLT><CLT 4>のって…
#. ひょっとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean that conversely, <CLT><CLT 3>the poison must\n"
"have been in<CLT><CLT 4>... Could it be...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

